# Project memory

## What this project is
[[ project_description ]]

ESP32-S3 C++ firmware using ESP-IDF (via PlatformIO), structured as Ports & Adapters (hexagonal-lite) so ~80% of the code is host-testable with GoogleTest. The project name is whatever folder you're in — there is no hardcoded name anywhere.

